Number = {1},
Pages = {218+},
Month = {JAN},
Abstract = {A survey of the foregoing contributions suggests eight areas of
   investigation into church-state relations in Europe which remain ripe
   for further research. This conclusion lists and attempts to outline them
   in a way which does justice to the complexity of the structure's and
   dynamics concerned as they continue to evolve particularly but not
   exclusively in those societies which are still currently undergoing
   processed of transition to full liberal democracy. It links them to some
   of the wider concerns which have occupied the attention of political
   scientists in recent years.},
